{"timestamp": "2026-08-20T08:39:59.241438+00:00", "type": "answer_done", "session_id": "default", "turn_id": 4, "answer": "I'm drawn to this role because your infrastructure spans FinTech and Blockchain—domains where reliability directly impacts customer trust and regulatory compliance, and that's where I want to build my depth as an SRE.\n\n- My 1.2 years at M&G gave me hands-on experience with Azure production environments, incident response, and automation, but I'm looking for a team where I can own larger reliability challenges end-to-end, since that's how you move from reactive monitoring into predictive infrastructure.\n- I've worked with the core tools you're using—Azure DevOps, PowerShell automation, Azure Monitor, and ServiceNow—so I can contribute immediately without ramp-up time, and I'm genuinely interested in deepening my Kubernetes and advanced monitoring skills on real production workloads.\n- Your focus on operational efficiency and system reliability aligns with how I think about the work—reducing MTTR and preventing incidents before they hit customers matters more to me than just keeping systems running.", "answer_ms": 4008}
